e is banned in the European Union, The use of chilli peppers as weapons\ndates back to pre-Columbian times (before 1492), when, it is said, Mayans burned rows of\nthem to create a stinging smokescreen to protect themselves enemies Aztecs\nalso put chilli on their teeth to kill tooth etal bs\ncontinues today.\nJoshua Tewksbury, a natural hii\nsensation we experience wh", "method": "ocr", "confidence": 93.3, "word_boxes": [{"text": "DING", "confidence": 79.010834, "box": [300, 203, 79, 27]}, {"text": "PASSAGE", "confidence": 94.732582, "box": [400, 182, 256, 69]}, {"text": "1", "confidence": 80.858406, "box": [625, 178, 32, 94]}, {"text": ":", "confidence": 25.168266, "box": [939, 226, 17, 9]}, {"text": "You", "confidence": 88.448708, "box": [191, 258, 55, 82]}, {"text": "shoukd", "confidence": 68.554169, "box": [273, 258, 96, 82]}, {"text": "spend", "confidence": 95.380936, "box": [382, 258, 83, 82]}, {"text": "about", "confidence": 96.692497, "box": [484, 258, 83, 82]}, {"text": "20", "confidence": 96.745918, "box": [587, 258, 28, 82]}, {"text": "minutes", "confidence": 83.36615, "box": [635, 258, 110, 82]}, {"text": "on", "confidence": 95.972954, "box": [758, 258, 35, 82]}, {"text": "Questions", "confidence": 73.239868, "box": [812, 258, 145, 82]}, {"text": "1-13,", "confidence": 80.235779, "box": [983, 258, 76, 82]}, {"text": "which", "confidence": 91.289963, "box": [1110, 262, 7, 2]}, {"text": "are", "confidence": 50.756393, "box": [1179, 294, 56, 16]}, {"text": "on", "confidence": 58.878181, "box": [187, 314, 39, 66]}, {"text": "pages", "confidence": 96.718147, "box": [242, 314, 88, 66]}, {"text": "2", "confidence": 94.994171, "box": [346, 330, 17, 33]}, {"text": "and", "confidence": 94.08876, "box": [379, 314, 50, 66]}, {"text": "3", "confidence": 63.93811, "box": [445, 331, 21, 34]}, {"text": "a", "confidence": 26.263512, "box": [1267, 338, 56, 42]}, {"text": "Chilli", "confidence": 95.603447, "box": [711, 451, 145, 51]}, {"text": "Peppers", "confidence": 96.2